# CANONICAL HOST: www.
#
# These rules all targeted the NON-www apex, which itself 301s to www — so
# every .org/.net visitor took TWO hops instead of one. index.html's v0.61.2
# note lists four places the host has to agree (index.html, robots.txt,
# netlify/functions/sitemap.js, netlify/edge-functions/og-prerender.js). This
# file is a fifth and was missed. If Netlify's primary domain ever flips to
# non-www, change it here too.

# Redirect .org variants
http://thebooksoracle.org/* https://www.thebooksoracle.com/:splat  301!
https://thebooksoracle.org/* https://www.thebooksoracle.com/:splat  301!
http://www.thebooksoracle.org/* https://www.thebooksoracle.com/:splat  301!
https://www.thebooksoracle.org/* https://www.thebooksoracle.com/:splat  301!

# Redirect .net variants
http://thebooksoracle.net/* https://www.thebooksoracle.com/:splat  301!
https://thebooksoracle.net/* https://www.thebooksoracle.com/:splat  301!
http://www.thebooksoracle.net/* https://www.thebooksoracle.com/:splat  301!
https://www.thebooksoracle.net/* https://www.thebooksoracle.com/:splat  301!

# Redirect reading.oracle.com subdomain
http://reading.oracle.com/* https://www.thebooksoracle.com/:splat  301!
https://reading.oracle.com/* https://www.thebooksoracle.com/:splat  301!